            "review_text": "steve m\nSouthport, United Kingdom605 contributions\n0\nA SUPERB BUSINESS LUNCH.\nJun 2017 • Business\nRecently had a business lunch at Yoshino which is situated in The Lotte Legend Hotel. Nice warm welcome, great table with views of the hotel swimming pool. Friendly efficient service, good lunch time menu with many set lunches. The eel was very good indeed and the egg custard. Will definitely visit again!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 15, 2017",
